  'r10.progTitle': 'Full program',
  'r10.introWhoT': 'Who is this challenge for?',
  'r10.introWho': 'For beginners: if you have never trained in a gym, or almost never, this is your starting point. The goal of these 21 days is not a physical result: it is building the skill, the habit and the discipline that prepare you for bigger challenges.',
  'r10.introWorkT': 'What will you work on in these 21 days?',
  'r10.introWork': 'Getting familiar with the exercises and the equipment, learning to log your activity day by day and building consistency: showing up, training and writing it down, week after week.',
  'r10.introProgT': 'What does “progressive” mean in this program?',
  'r10.introProg': 'That the demand grows step by step, with clear rules: each week your exercises rotate to the next variant of the same movement, and when you log two sessions in a row completing an exercise, the app PROPOSES a small load increase — you decide whether to accept it; it never goes up on its own. Starting loads come from your fitness test when you have one; when information is missing, no weights are invented: the exercise is marked as pending calibration. No guaranteed physical results are promised.',
