  'stage.stripLact': 'Life stage declared: Lactation · updated {date} — The evidence-based recommendation (+330 to +400 kcal/day, Institute of Medicine, 2005) is shown to her; her goals calculate as usual.',
  'stage.stripPost': 'Life stage declared: Postpartum · updated {date} — Gradual return; pace her plan with her recovery.',
